CHAPTER 8
MODULE DESCRIPTION
Home Module
Provides access to all municipal services through a simple dashboard.
Login Module
Allows users to securely access the application.
Complaint Module
Enables complaint registration with image upload.
Tracking Module
Displays complaint progress using Complaint ID.
Dashboard Module
Shows municipal statistics, community feed, and city updates.
AI Chatbot Module
Provides municipal assistance through conversational interaction.
Voice Assistant Module
Supports speech recognition and speech synthesis.
Government Schemes Module
Displays welfare schemes and official government links.
Contact Module
Allows citizens to communicate with municipal authorities.
